<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LIN TV OFF LIST.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LIN TV OFF LIST.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz analyst Vinton Vickers said he took LIN Television Corp off the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said has the stock now rated neutral.</p>
<p>-- LIN announced late Tuesday that it was being acquired by provate Hicks, Muse, Tate &amp; Furst Inc for $1.7 billion, or $47.50 per share in cash, plus interest.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-11/16 to 46-15/16.</p>
</text>
